SUMMARY:Union Samples : Rio Mare
DESCRIPTION:Taste the rich flavour of Rio Mare’s classic tuna in olive oil\, sampling on April 22 and 23\, 2026 at Union Station’s Bay Union Samples Kiosk. Don’t miss your chance to take a can of our premium Italian tuna home with you!\n\nHours may vary\, sampling might start later or be cut short due to sample availability; breaks will be taken throughout the day. Guests are not permitted to stand or wait near the kiosk during these times.\nWe ask everyone to remain respectful and polite to our staff at all times. Failure to follow these guidelines will result in being denied a sample.
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/union-samples-rio-mare-2/2026-04-22/
