SUMMARY:Layla; Miznon After Dark Party
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to dive into a wild night of flavors and beats at the ultimate Miznon after-hours bash! \n\n\n\n\nGet ready to dive into a wild night of flavors and beats at the ultimate after-hours bash! \nLAYLA – Miznon After Dark Party\nOnce our doors close\, our Layla begins! \nJoin us at Miznon Union Station on May 2 for a late-night party filled with good music\, great snacks\, and even better vibes. \nBeats by Dj LoNormali\nBites by Miznon \nYour ticket includes a spread of our favourite late night cravings; so you can snack\, mingle\, and have some fun – Miznon style. \nDoors open at 9PM and we go late. \nCome dressed to vibe\, ready to meet new people\, and stay for the kind of night you don’t want to end. \n25+ event | Food included with ticket\nDrinks à la carte\nMiznon Union Station May 2 | 9PM – Late \nFor tickets visit : \n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/layla-miznon-after-dark-party-tickets-1987015118709
URL:https://torontounion.ca/event/layla-miznon-after-dark-party/
LOCATION:Union\, 65 Front Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/webp:https://torontounion.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/miznon.webp
